+summary: "Clinical pathway for abortion, for people considering ending a pregnancy: early medical abortion (EMA) at home up to 10 weeks, and referral for other types. Covers ectopic red flags, assessment, mifepristone and misoprostol, aftercare, complications, and referral. Always discuss with your doctor."
