+summary: "Clinical pathway for a pregnant woman's first antenatal visit: working out the due date, history and pre-eclampsia risk, routine blood tests, and finding a midwife. Covers folic acid, iodine, aspirin, vitamin D, vaccines, and when to refer. Always discuss with your doctor."
